+/// Maps an [`ApplyError`] ([`muxsmith_core::planner::apply_suggestion`]) to
+/// an [`IpcError`] (D43/D49 "The shell mapping", verbatim). Every variant
+/// here is a frontend-side bug surfaced as data rather than silently
